=== entry 1fa2b22a8856
kind: translation
rules: invoke
intent: The description names both invocations, /architect for Claude Code and $architect for Codex. Everything else stays verbatim.
--- upstream
---
name: architect
description: "Sketch types, signatures, and module structure before code, then stay in the loop while implementation fills in. Use for /architect, 'architect this', 'design this', or non-trivial work where jumping to code would lock in the wrong shape."
disable-model-invocation: true
---
--- patched
---
name: architect
description: "Sketch types, signatures, and module structure before code, then stay in the loop while implementation fills in. Use for /architect or $architect, 'architect this', 'design this', or non-trivial work where jumping to code would lock in the wrong shape."
