=== entry 5d870afeba5c
kind: translation
rules: model-role
intent: Architect's arena takes its runners from the `architect runners` line in the project models file, else willyskills's default, in place of the `arena runners` line. Upstream dropped that role and runs arena on its own runners; willyskills keeps it as a panel that lists two model families on purpose. Preserve that only a large or contested design runs arena.
--- upstream
For a large or contested design, run the **arena** skill instead of sketching alone.
--- patched
For a large or contested design, run the **arena** skill instead of sketching alone, with its runners from the `architect runners` line in {{snippet:models-file}}, else {{model:architect runners}}, in place of the `arena runners` line.
